  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">Walli-Walli is said to sleep in the Darksea to fly amongst dreams and bestow boons from the heavens above; through training or a discovery of a new talent in your sleep, you have also learned to swim in such spaces. Your Slithering Form feature expands to include a choice to enter a Cosmic form where you manifest energy upon your fins and tail, allowing you to gain a fly speed equal to your land speed plus 10 feet while you are in a vacuum or in the astral plane. When you awake from a deep sleep after reaching 17th level, you gain the Cosmic trait.</span></p>"
